                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Annex 2]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Draft Communiqué</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Conversations between the United States, United Kingdom, and Soviet Union
                    delegations in Washington regarding the establishment of a World Security
                    Organization have now been completed. The three delegations are making reports
                    to their respective Governments who will consider these reports and will in due
                    course issue a simultaneous statement on the subject.</p>
            </div>
